{"resourceIdentifier":"3378","resourceName":"Animal Manure Management System (AMMS) GHG Mitigation Project In Huoqiu county Anhui province","description":"Animal Manure Management System (AMMS) GHG Mitigation Project In Huoqiu county Anhui province is located at Shidian Town, Huoqiu County, Lu’an City, Anhui Province, P.R.China. The Project is invested, constructed and operated by Huoqiu huizhao Renewable Energy Technology Co., Ltd.. The project will introduce a new waste management system to treat animal manure from 8 livestock farms in Huoqiu County to replace the current open anaerobic lagoons. The treated manure is collected by tank trucks from the livestock farms to the project and the collected material is subsequently treated. \r\nBy treating the manure with closed anaerobic digesters, the project avoids the emission of methane that would be generated from animal manure in current\r\nopen anaerobic lagoons. The biogas generated during the treatment process will be partly used for electricity generation and the rest will be supplied to\r\nusers nearby for heat generation. The electricity generated will be supplied to East China Power Grid (ECPG) to displace equivalent electricity from ECPG\r\ndominated by fossil fuel-fired plants. The fermented sludge from the closed anaerobic digesters will be treated in aerobic composting system and used as\r\nfertilizer. Wastewater from the treatment system will be used for agriculture irrigation.","location":{"latitude":32.278261,"longitude":116.070081},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-01","endExclusive":"2022-12-02","endInclusive":"2022-12-01"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3378"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Huoqiu huizhao Renewable Energy Technology Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-13811834366"},{"type":"string","value":"270017824@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"76777"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/09/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 20/03/2023 - 19/03/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69346&IDKEY=0lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098w95628134","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Huoqiu-VCS-Project-Description V1.0.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-07-05T06:33:34.853Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69465&IDKEY=n0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9395792235","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Huoqiu-VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-07-07T07:59:38.373Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=75852&IDKEY=9kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909104599908","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Huoqiu-VCS-Project-Description (under validation).pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-11T07:36:20.037Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96746&IDKEY